  "summary": "AIOHTTP: Pure-Python parser request smuggling",
  "details": "### Summary\n\nThe pure Python parser is vulnerable to an HTTP request smuggling attack.\n\n### Impact\n\nIf users are using the Python parser (`AIOHTTP_NO_EXTENSIONS`, or not a standard wheel installed), then an application may be vulnerable to a request smuggling attack.\n\n### Workaround\n\nSwitch to the default C parser.",
